WEBVTT

00:29:57.561 --> 00:30:01.149
which is a 30-billion dollar company

00:30:01.173 --> 00:30:04.379
that does amazing things with food.

00:30:04.403 --> 00:30:08.445
And it also now has AI backed up
in their capabilities.

00:30:08.800 --> 00:30:12.998
In China, if you want
to eat anything, anytime,

00:30:13.022 --> 00:30:14.625
just open your phone app,

00:30:14.649 --> 00:30:17.770
and there are thousand places
that will deliver to you

00:30:17.794 --> 00:30:20.127
at around 70 cents per delivery.

00:30:20.151 --> 00:30:24.786
Because companies competed
on the lower cost of delivery

00:30:24.810 --> 00:30:26.768
in order to win more customers.

00:30:26.792 --> 00:30:28.036
And at the same time,

00:30:28.060 --> 00:30:33.220
they executed AI algorithms
for routing food to your home,